        <div class="max-w-2xl relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-soft mb-3 border border-white/15">
            <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="size-3.5 text-cyan animate-pulse"></i>
            GraphRAG + Ollama API (qwen2.5:7b)
